{"book":"zhongyong","id":"sishu.zhongyong.14","index":14,"passages":[{"editorial_status":"unverified-draft","id":"sishu.zhongyong.14.01","number":1,"ruby_paragraphs":[[{"pinyin":"jūn","traditional":"君","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zǐ","traditional":"子","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"sù","traditional":"素","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"qí","traditional":"其","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"wèi","traditional":"位","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"ér","traditional":"而","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"xíng","traditional":"行","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"pinyin":"bù","traditional":"不","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"愿","pinyin":"yuàn","traditional":"願","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"hū","traditional":"乎","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"qí","traditional":"其","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"wài","traditional":"外","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"。"}]],"translation_indonesian":"Seorang Junzi - Kuncu berbuat sesuai dengan kedudukannya, ia tidak ingin berbuat luar dari padanya. (S.S. XIV:26, 29)"},{"editorial_status":"unverified-draft","id":"sishu.zhongyong.14.02","number":2,"ruby_paragraphs":[[{"pinyin":"sù","traditional":"素","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"fù","traditional":"富","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"贵","pinyin":"guì","traditional":"貴","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"pinyin":"xíng","traditional":"行","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"hū","traditional":"乎","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"fù","traditional":"富","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"贵","pinyin":"guì","traditional":"貴","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"；"},{"pinyin":"sù","traditional":"素","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"贫","pinyin":"pín","traditional":"貧","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"贱","pinyin":"jiàn","traditional":"賤","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"pinyin":"xíng","traditional":"行","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"hū","traditional":"乎","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"贫","pinyin":"pín","traditional":"貧","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"贱","pinyin":"jiàn","traditional":"賤","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"；"},{"pinyin":"sù","traditional":"素","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yí","traditional":"夷","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"dí","traditional":"狄","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"pinyin":"xíng","traditional":"行","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"hū","traditional":"乎","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yí","traditional":"夷","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"dí","traditional":"狄","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"；"},{"pinyin":"sù","traditional":"素","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"huàn","traditional":"患","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"难","pinyin":"nán","traditional":"難","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"pinyin":"xíng","traditional":"行","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"hū","traditional":"乎","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"huàn","traditional":"患","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"难","pinyin":"nán","traditional":"難","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"。"},{"pinyin":"jūn","traditional":"君","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zǐ","traditional":"子","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"无","pinyin":"wú","traditional":"無","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"rù","traditional":"入","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"ér","traditional":"而","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"bù","traditional":"不","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zì","traditional":"自","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"dé","traditional":"得","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yān","traditional":"焉","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"。"}]],"translation_indonesian":"Dikala kaya dan mulia, ia berbuat sebagai layaknya seorang kaya dan mulia; dikala miskin dan berkedudukan rendah, ia berbuat sebagai layaknya seorang miskin dan berkedudukan rendah; di kala berdiam diantara suku I dan Tik, ia berbuat sebagai layaknya seorang suku I dan Tik; dikala ia sedih dan menghadapi kesukaran, ia berbuat sebagai layaknya seorang yang sedih dan berkesukaran. Maka seorang Junzi - Kuncu di dalam keadaan bagaimanapun, selalu berhasil menjaga dirinya."},{"editorial_status":"unverified-draft","id":"sishu.zhongyong.14.03","number":3,"ruby_paragraphs":[[{"pinyin":"zài","traditional":"在","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"shàng","traditional":"上","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"wèi","traditional":"位","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"pinyin":"bù","traditional":"不","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"líng","traditional":"陵","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"xià","traditional":"下","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"；"},{"pinyin":"zài","traditional":"在","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"xià","traditional":"下","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"wèi","traditional":"位","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"pinyin":"bù","traditional":"不","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yuán","traditional":"援","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"shàng","traditional":"上","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"；"},{"pinyin":"zhèng","traditional":"正","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"jǐ","traditional":"己","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"ér","traditional":"而","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"bù","traditional":"不","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"qiú","traditional":"求","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"于","pinyin":"yú","traditional":"於","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"rén","traditional":"人","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"则","pinyin":"zé","traditional":"則","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"无","pinyin":"wú","traditional":"無","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yuàn","traditional":"怨","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"。"},{"pinyin":"shàng","traditional":"上","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"bù","traditional":"不","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yuàn","traditional":"怨","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"tiān","traditional":"天","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"pinyin":"xià","traditional":"下","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"bù","traditional":"不","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yóu","traditional":"尤","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"rén","traditional":"人","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"。"}]],"translation_indonesian":"Dikala berkedudukan tinggi ia tidak meremehkan bawahannya, dan di dalam kedudukan rendah ia tidak bersikap penjilat kepada atasannya; ia hanya meluruskan diri dan tidak mencari- cari kesalahan orang lain. Demikianlah maka ia tidak mempunyai rasa sesal. Ke atas ia tidak menyesali Tuhan YME dan ke bawah tidak menyalahkan sesamanya."},{"editorial_status":"unverified-draft","id":"sishu.zhongyong.14.04","number":4,"ruby_paragraphs":[[{"pinyin":"gù","traditional":"故","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"jūn","traditional":"君","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zǐ","traditional":"子","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"jū","traditional":"居","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yì","traditional":"易","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yǐ","traditional":"以","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"qí","traditional":"俟","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"mìng","traditional":"命","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"pinyin":"xiǎo","traditional":"小","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"rén","traditional":"人","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"xíng","traditional":"行","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"险","pinyin":"xiǎn","traditional":"險","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yǐ","traditional":"以","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"jiào","traditional":"徼","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"xìng","traditional":"幸","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"。"}]],"translation_indonesian":"Maka seorang Junzi - Kuncu itu selalu damai tenteram menerima Firman, sebaliknya seorang rendah budi melakukan perbuatan sesat untuk memuaskan nafsunya."},{"editorial_status":"unverified-draft","id":"sishu.zhongyong.14.05","number":5,"ruby_paragraphs":[[{"pinyin":"zǐ","traditional":"子","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yuē","traditional":"曰","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"：“"},{"pinyin":"shè","traditional":"射","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yǒu","traditional":"有","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"sì","traditional":"似","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"hū","traditional":"乎","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"jūn","traditional":"君","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zǐ","traditional":"子","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"。"},{"pinyin":"shī","traditional":"失","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"诸","pinyin":"zhū","traditional":"諸","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zhèng","traditional":"正","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"鹄","pinyin":"hú","traditional":"鵠","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"pinyin":"fǎn","traditional":"反","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"qiú","traditional":"求","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"诸","pinyin":"zhū","traditional":"諸","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"qí","traditional":"其","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"shēn","traditional":"身","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"。”"}]],"translation_indonesian":"Nabi bersabda, \"Hal memanah itu seperti sikap seorang Junzi - Kuncu. Bila memanahnya meleset dari bulan-bulannya, sipemanah berbalik mencari sebab-sebab kegagalannya di dalam diri sendiri.\" (S.S. III: 7). TENGAH SEMPURNA BAB XIV (Setapak demi setapak)"}],"source_file":"02 - Zhong Yong 中庸/14 - Bab XIII - Berperilaku Tepat.md","title":"Bab XIII — Berperilaku Tepat"}
